# CRX signing key -- NEVER commit.
# Anyone holding this private key can ship updates that impersonate the
# extension. It is only needed for locally sideloaded builds; Chrome Web Store
# submissions use the .zip and are signed by Google.
crx-signing-key.pem
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# Built packages -- regenerate with build-crx.js (Chromium) or the documented
# Firefox zip command. Not committed so they can never silently drift from the
# source they were built from.
/resize_yt_to_window_size.crx
/resize_yt_to_window_size.zip
/resize_yt_to_window_size.xpi

# Transient scratch files written by the build/verify scripts
.crx-payload.zip
.verify-payload/

# Stale backup of a previous package
*.bak

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
